r plan, trace it in Blender and create the walls.\n\nHappy Blending!\n\nTimestamps:\n0:00 What we'll do\n0:15 How we'll get there\n0:25 Getting a floor plan\n1:32 Getting started\n1:49 Basic Navigation\n2:06 Import your plan into Blender\n2:49 Basic transform operations\n3:25 Setting up the plan and units\n4:02 It all stars with a plane\n4:56 Scaling the plane to real dimensions\n5:29 Getting the plan in place\n6:40 Tracing the outline\n9:10 Tracing inner walls\n10:23 Break\n10:28 Continue tracing inner walls\n14:24 Remove doubled vertices\n14:35 Save\n14:41 Make the floor\n15:41 Remove unnecessary geometry\n16:23 Make the floor's faces\n16:34 Make the background\n17:20 Extruding the walls in Z\n17:36 Reviewing face orientation\n18:15 Adding thickness to walls with Modifiers\n18:54 Fixing face orientation errors\n21:26 Note on face orientation\n22:05 Save As\n22:30 If you need thick and thin walls\n22:47 Great job!","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":19,"length":52,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CJcDEM2rARgBIhMIso347NuskgMVzUU_AR3LbTQ5ygEE4UoTdw==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"/watch?v=0JdX11vu7Zo","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_WATCH","rootVe":3832}},"watchEndpoint":{"videoId":"0JdX11vu7Zo","startTimeSeconds":0,"watchEndpointSupportedOnesieConfig":{"html5PlaybackOnesieConfig":{"commonConfig":{"url":"https://rr4---sn-qxo7rn7y.googlevideo.com/initplayback?source=youtube\u0026oeis=1\u0026c=WEB\u0026oad=3200\u0026ovd=3200\u0026oaad=11000\u0026oavd=11000\u0026ocs=700\u0026oewis=1\u0026oputc=1\u0026ofpcc=1\u0026msp=1\u0026odepv=1\u0026id=d09757d75beeed9a\u0026ip=34.133.223.192\u0026mt=1769550775\u0026oweuc=\u0026pxtags=Cg4KAnR4Egg1MTUzOTgzMQ\u0026rxtags=Cg4KAnR4Egg1MTUzOTgzMA%2CCg4KAnR4Egg1MTUzOTgzMQ"}}}}}},"onTapOptions":{"accessibilityInfo":{"accessibilityLabel":"YouTube Channel Link: In-Depth Floor Plan Tutorial Part 2 [UPDATED 2025]"}}},{"startIndex":91,"length":52,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CJcDEM2rARgBIhMIso3